WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.534
-We have exactly four shows left

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:05.033
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:07.067
for that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:10.767
It's time for 12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters! Here we go!

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:13.267
-♪ 12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:17.100
♪ Four days left ♪

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:20.567
That is right!

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:24.200
Every show between now
and Christmas,

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.501
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:29.701
a "Return of the Mack"-adocious
Christmas sweater

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:31.868
from the Countdown
to Christmas cabinet.

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:36.701
Since there are four shows left,
let's open door number four.

00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:38.501
[ Drum roll ]

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:40.701
Right here.
Whenever you're ready. Yeah.

00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:42.267
Thank you very...

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:44.901
Wow.

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:47.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:50.300
♪♪

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.400
[ Bells jingling ]

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.968
This is nice here.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.334
Can we dim the lights
a little bit?

00:00:57.334 --> 00:01:00.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:03.067
Ooh. Look at that.

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.334
Wow. This is fantastic. Alright.

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:07.901
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.000
Everyone look
at your seat number.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.200
If I call your number,

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.601
I need you to jump up
and let me know where you are.

00:01:14.601 --> 00:01:16.601
Quest,
can I get a drum roll, please?

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:17.834
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:19.767
Who wants me to pick
their numbers to get one?!

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:21.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:23.734
Here we go!

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:26.200
420!

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.834
♪♪

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:31.133
That's a good one right there...

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:33.067
♪♪

00:01:33.067 --> 00:01:37.901
Hey, bud. How you doing?
Come on over.

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:39.133
♪♪

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:40.734
Nice to see you.
-It's nice to see you, too!

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:41.934
-How are you?
-I'm doing great.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.667
-What is your name?
-My name is Julia.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:45.100
I'm from Virginia.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.133
-From Virginia! Julia is here!

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:48.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:50.067
All the way from Virginia.

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:52.033
Now, Julia, you look very nice,

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:53.901
but it gets --
it gets chilly in Virginia.

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:55.667
-It does.
-Yeah. And you have sweaters.

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:57.501
And you have, you know,
things to wear.

00:01:57.501 --> 00:01:59.100
-Yeah. Not enough, though.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.868
This is -- This will be
the perfect addition.

00:02:00.868 --> 00:02:03.167
-And if you're out at night,
I'm just saying...

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:05.868
You know, it's safety.
Safety is sexy, you know?

00:02:05.868 --> 00:02:07.000
That's what I always say.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:08.667
-Yeah.
-Would you like to try this on?

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:10.367
-I would love to.
-I think this will be --

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:13.300
This will go great
with the dress.

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:16.033
It'll go great with the dress,
I think.

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:18.167
Good luck.

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:19.968
-We're almost there.
-Yeah. That's right.

00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:21.534
It's not easy to get into,
but...

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:23.801
-Where's the head?
-Oh, yeah. No. That's good.

00:02:23.801 --> 00:02:25.834
Ohh! Ohh!

00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:28.968
[ Cheers and applause ]
Ohh! Ohh!

00:02:28.968 --> 00:02:32.334
Oh! Knock-out!
Are you kidding me?

00:02:32.334 --> 00:02:34.801
Thank you so much.
You look fantastic.

00:02:34.801 --> 00:02:36.467
Happy holidays. Good to see you.

